# === Project memories — local only, never tracked ===
# Structure: keep projects/ directory but ignore all content
# Only projects/README.md and projects/.gitkeep may be tracked
projects/*
!projects/
!projects/README.md
!projects/.gitkeep

# Per-project local state (redundant with above but explicit)
**/agent_docs/
**/runs/
**/evaluation_runs/
**/repo/
**/*.local.bak/
**/*.bak/

